# Glued data{…} is the quote data {…} (decisions data-tag-words, spaced-tag, card glued-data); a block's entry named
# data stays a pair

'src = 1; data{type: "image", src} == data {type: "image", src}'	yes
'type(data{a: 1}) == type(data {a: 1})'	yes
'x = data{a: 1}; x is pair'	no
'm = {data: {a: 1}}; m.data.a'	1
